  "html": "<section class=\"lesson-page\"> <div class=\"course-intro-card\"> <span class=\"exam-badge\"> TASK-BASED SIMULATION </span> <h2> Cash-to-Accrual Conversion </h2> <p> Convert cash-basis amounts to accrual-basis revenue, expenses, and net income. </p> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-card\"> <h3> Company Information </h3> <div class=\"tbs-data-row\"> <span> Cash Collected from Customers </span> <strong> $500,000 </strong> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-row\"> <span> Beginning Accounts Receivable </span> <strong> $40,000 </strong> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-row\"> <span> Ending Accounts Receivable </span> <strong> $55,000 </strong> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-row\"> <span> Cash Paid for Operating Expenses </span> <strong> $280,000 </strong> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-row\"> <span> Beginning Accounts Payable </span> <strong> $30,000 </strong> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-row\"> <span> Ending Accounts Payable </span> <strong> $38,000 </strong> </div> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-card\"> <h3> Required </h3> <div class=\"tbs-question\"> <label for=\"tbs5-q1\"> 1. Accrual-Basis Revenue </label> <input type=\"number\" id=\"tbs5-q1\" class=\"tbs-input\" placeholder=\"Enter amount\"> </div> <div class=\"tbs-question\"> <label for=\"tbs5-q2\"> 2. Accrual-Basis Operating Expenses </label> <input type=\"number\" id=\"tbs5-q2\" class=\"tbs-input\" placeholder=\"Enter amount\"> </div> <div class=\"tbs-question\"> <label for=\"tbs5-q3\"> 3. Accrual-Basis Net Income </label> <input type=\"number\" id=\"tbs5-q3\" class=\"tbs-input\" placeholder=\"Enter amount\"> </div> </div> <div id=\"tbs5-result\"></div> </section>",
  "explanation": "<div class=\"tbs-results\"> <div class=\"key-points\"> <h3> Correct Answers </h3> <p> 1. Accrual-Basis Revenue: <strong>$515,000</strong> </p> <p> 2. Accrual-Basis Operating Expenses: <strong>$288,000</strong> </p> <p> 3. Accrual-Basis Net Income: <strong>$227,000</strong> </p> </div> <div class=\"example-box\"> <h3> Revenue Conversion </h3> <div class=\"formula-box\"> Cash Collected + Ending A/R − Beginning A/R = $500,000 + $55,000 − $40,000 = $515,000 </div> <h3> Expense Conversion </h3> <div class=\"formula-box\"> Cash Paid + Ending A/P − Beginning A/P = $280,000 + $38,000 − $30,000 = $288,000 </div> <h3> Net Income </h3> <div class=\"formula-box\"> $515,000 − $288,000 = $227,000 </div> </div> </div>",
